/P 144 0 R
/T (Perched atop a scenic hill overlooking Narragansett Bay, our Waterfront Tent provides a standout setting for corporate events, combining coastal beauty with refined functionality. This open-air venue features faux wood flooring, clear tent siding, and ambient bistro lighting that transitions effortlessly from day to evening. With built-in heating for cooler nights and nearby upscale portable restrooms, the space ensures comfort and convenient for all attendees. Accommodating up to 150 guests for a seated program or 200 for a cocktail-style reception, the Waterfront Tent offers a memorable backdrop for company celebrations, networking events, retreats, and client experiences by the sea.)
